/issues/1060#issuecomment-722553704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1060","id":722553704,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMjU1MzcwNA==","user":{"login":"lal12","id":14139770,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTM5Nzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14139770?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12","html_url":"https://github.com/lal12","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lal12/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-05T18:20:10Z","updated_at":"2020-11-05T18:20:10Z","body":"Well after reading the guidelines IMHO I would say that this license fits, apart from point 2 and 3 which are debatable. \r\n\r\n> 2. The license is structured to be generally usable by anyone. It is not specific to one project, consortium or corporation.\r\n\r\nI would say it is structured to be generally usable by anyone. I think it is not necessary specific in terms of structure, though depending on the interpretation debatable.\r\n\r\n> 3. The license has actual, substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered. Substantial use may be demonstrated via use in many projects, or in one or a few significant projects. For new licenses, there are definitive plans for the license to be used in one or a few significant projects.\r\n\r\nWell it is hard to know what exactly is \"one significant project\" though comparing it to e.g. libpng, libtiff, imagemagick I would say that about as widely used as them. \r\n\r\nSo in my opinion if including the examples in my [previous post](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1060#issuecomment-683257320) is considered correct this license should also be included. If it is considered not to be correct by the currenty guidelines anymore then the libgd license probably wouldn't be useful to include.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722553704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/730529115","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1060#issuecomment-730529115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1060","id":730529115,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDczMDUyOTExNQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-